{"source_id":"cn-nmpa-2021-50","market":"CN","source_type":"official_regulation","title":"化妆品功效宣称评价规范","source_url":"https://mpa.yn.gov.cn/zfxxgk/zcwj/qtwj/gjwj/202112/t20211222_1224866.html","effective_date":"2021-05-01","checked_at":"2026-09-15","summary":"化妆品功效宣称需要适当评价和充分科学依据；产品功效宣称依据摘要按规定公布。","automation":"manual_product_evidence_required"}
{"source_id":"cn-nmpa-2021-77","market":"CN","source_type":"official_regulation","title":"化妆品标签管理办法","source_url":"https://www.gov.cn/gbgl/bbb734277fe64ea99ef1547669063192/files/05886a5c1b6a4647a159adf25ed38bdd.pdf","effective_date":"2022-05-01","checked_at":"2026-09-15","summary":"标签不得使用医疗暗示、虚假夸大或绝对化表达，也不得使用无法核验的科研或权威背书。","automation":"partial_regex_screening"}
{"source_id":"us-fda-cosmetic-claims","market":"US","source_type":"official_guidance","title":"FDA Cosmetics Labeling Claims","source_url":"https://www.fda.gov/cosmetics/cosmetics-labeling/cosmetics-labeling-claims","effective_date":null,"checked_at":"2026-09-15","summary":"化妆品标签声明应真实且不误导；疾病治疗、预防等声明可能使产品被认定为药品。","automation":"partial_regex_screening"}
{"source_id":"us-ftc-ad-substantiation","market":"US","source_type":"official_guidance","title":"FTC Advertising Substantiation Policy","source_url":"https://www.ftc.gov/legal-library/browse/ftc-policy-statement-regarding-advertising-substantiation","effective_date":null,"checked_at":"2026-09-15","summary":"客观广告声明发布前应有适当支持依据；证据水平需与实际声明相符。","automation":"manual_product_evidence_required"}
{"source_id":"eu-reg-655-2013","market":"EU","source_type":"official_regulation","title":"Commission Regulation (EU) No 655/2013","source_url":"https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/reg/2013/655/oj/eng","effective_date":"2013-07-11","checked_at":"2026-09-15","summary":"化妆品声明应真实、有可核验的支持依据，并与产品信息文件中的证明材料一致；不得暗示欧盟主管机关批准。","automation":"partial_regex_screening_and_manual_product_evidence_required"}
